      <p>Moringa has a fresh, earthy taste — which makes it a natural partner for fruit. This smoothie takes three minutes and one blender.</p>
      <h2 id="highlights">Highlights</h2><ul class="ba-hl"><li>Ready in 3 minutes.</li><li>1 teaspoon Moringa per glass.</li><li>Swap spinach for kale if you like.</li></ul>
      <h2 id="s0">You'll need</h2><p>1 frozen banana · 1 cup almond or oat milk · 1 handful spinach · 1 tsp Veda Moringa Powder · ½ cup pineapple or mango · squeeze of lime</p><h2 id="s1">Method</h2><p>Add the milk first, then everything else. Blend for 45–60 seconds until smooth, taste, and pour.</p>
      
