      <h2 id="faq">Frequently asked questions</h2><details class="ba-faq"><summary>Can I make it ahead?</summary><p>It's best fresh, but keeps in the fridge for a few hours — shake before drinking.</p></details><details class="ba-faq"><summary>How much Moringa powder goes in the smoothie?</summary><p>One teaspoon of Veda Moringa Powder per glass.</p></details><details class="ba-faq"><summary>Can I use kale instead of spinach?</summary><p>Yes — the recipe works with either.</p></details>
      
